{"ref":"BDB, בְּתוּלִים","hw":"בְּתוּלִים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּתוּלִים</span></big>  <strong>n.f. virginity</strong>, pl. abs. intens. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.14\">Dt 22:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.20\">20</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּתוּלֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.15\">Dt 22:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.17\">17</a>, all concrete, <em>tokens of virginity;</em> abstr., sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּתוּלַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:37\" href=\"/Judges.11.37\">Ju 11:37</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּתוּלֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.13\">Lv 21:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:38\" href=\"/Judges.11.38\">Ju 11:38</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.8\">Ez 23:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּתוּלֵיהֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.3\">Ez 23:3</a>.","next":"BDB, בָּתַק","prev":"BDB, בְּתוּלָה"}